OL,3,GNEWSACouncil-owned developer faces
OL,4,A#7.7m cash shortfall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council-owned developer could face a
OL,7,F#7.7m cash shortfall by 2029, a report
OL,8,Fhas warned.
OL,10,FThis Land, which is wholly owned by
OL,11,FCambridgeshire County Council, could be
OL,12,Funable to repay loans and interest it
OL,13,Fowes the authority, it said.
OL,15,FThe council-owned developer said sales
OL,16,Fand developments were broadly "on
OL,17,Ftrack", but that delayed property deals
OL,18,Fleft it with less money than it had
OL,19,Fpredicted this year.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
