OL,3,GNEWSACouncil-owned developer faces
OL,4,A#7.7m cash shortfall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report said: "On the current
OL,7,Fforecast, [This Land] would not be able
OL,8,Fto meet the final loan and accrued
OL,9,Finterest obligations without additional
OL,10,Freceipts, changes to timing or other
OL,11,Fshareholder-supported mitigation."
